Hold {lb} for the weapon ring, aiming with the right stick {rs}: primary, second primary, sidearm, melee and grenade. {rb} throws a grenade.
{select} opens the inventory, and a long press of {select} the map. In the inventory and map the right stick moves the pointer, {rt} clicks and {lt} right-clicks; drag items by holding {rt}.
Chat needs typing: open the on-screen keyboard with {guide} + {west}.
The game uses Easy Anti-Cheat; the pad reaches it as an ordinary keyboard and mouse.
